    <td background="images/bg.gif"><font class=""><a href="modules.php?name=News&new_topic=5">Movies</a></font><br><font class="testo_notizia" color="#000000"><b>Guy Ritchie's Revolver to get digital push through Greenroom.</b></font></td>
